    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Right as rain. Scratches! And I got to smash in a few A-Zone dirtbags for the trouble. Heheh, fine deal to me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "And it winds down like this every time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "You mean Barton?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Yeah, more or less. He's the jailers' Super. Always shows up at times like these, puts on the vaudeville and hits the brakes. Then says some meaningful crap."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Especially moments like now when the place's stopped over at a city, the warden's gone and he acts like he's lord of the prison."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Dropped on his head as a kid."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "But it ain't every time this happens, I'll tell you that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Plenty of times it don't stop for nothin'... I'd say most of the time, actually. Not that often it's over when over says, like today."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "But when it just won't end, you'll see Barton call in his safety."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "His what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Yup. There he is."
