    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Barton",
        "text": "You oughta learn from Mr. Anthony's example here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Barton",
        "text": "He might be a prisoner, but he esteems rationality, and he does not make his first resort violence. In his downtime, he likes to read. Write. Listen to records. Mighty fine boy!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Bleuch."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "You don't like Anthony?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "No, no, no, don't get me wrong, Kafka."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Ain't no-one in this prison who'd cross Anthony."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Usually, he's just like Barton said. Good to other folks. But we all know he's the biggest, muscliest goddamn shot in this place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "They say when he came into prison, first thing he did was go and beat every last guy in C-Zone into line."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Damn right. And anyone else from C-Zone barely gets to meet us, but he's the real thing. Swell as a bell. A-Zone or B-Zone, everyone falls in with him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Yeah. I'm just barfing having to look at Barton."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Listen to him. You think he's praisin' Anthony right now? He's mocking him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Anthony's the only guy he can't lift his head against, but he needs Anthony to wrangle us, so this is the only way he can do it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_135#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Barton",
        "text": "We are Mansfield State Prison. State! Prison. We are a pilot penitentiary with special approval from the capital. We will serve as a shining example to the other states."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_133"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner B",
        "text": "Tch. We're a crowd of convicts. Example your face..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_135#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Barton",
        "text": "In short, I hope you can now reflect on yourselves. Reflect for my sake!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Barton",
        "text": "Let's go, Anthony. You've got an hour of hittin' the books today."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_264_Mountain_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Anthony",
        "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "So usually you don't even see Anthony?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Usually, I guess?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Timetabling for the serious offenders is outta step with ours, and most of the time they're just staying in the C-Zone tower."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "What, you wanna see him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Mayhaps I do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "I wanna talk about something with him. Obviously, not something the jailers can know about."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_133",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "B-Zone Prisoner A",
        "text": "Don't worry, I get'cha. If you wanna have a little heart-to-heart with him, it's not like you don't have a shot..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
